<DocsLayout>
  <h1>mitch-risk</h1>

  <p>mitch-risk is a lightweight, self-hosted <strong>vendor risk management</strong> platform. It helps small-to-medium businesses assess, score, and track third-party vendor risk against industry compliance frameworks.</p>

  <h2>Key concepts</h2>

  <table class="key-table">
    <tr>
      <th>Concept</th>
      <th>What it is</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Template</strong></td>
      <td>A reusable questionnaire — sections, questions, risk weights, expected answers</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Assessment</strong></td>
      <td>A questionnaire sent to a vendor — frozen snapshot of a template</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Vendor</strong></td>
      <td>A third-party company being evaluated for risk</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Finding</strong></td>
      <td>A gap or non-compliant answer surfaced during scoring</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Framework</strong></td>
      <td>A compliance standard mapped to questions (ISO 27001, SOC 2, NIST CSF, Essential Eight)</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h2>How it works</h2>

  <pre><code>  Staff builds template ──▶ Assessment sent to vendor ──▶ Vendor answers questions
       │                                                        │
       ▼                                                        ▼
  Questions mapped to              Auto-scoring generates        │
  framework controls               findings + RAG score          │
                                          │                      │
                                          ▼                      ▼
                                   Reviewer approves       Portal shows read-
                                   or requests changes     only results</code></pre>

  <h2>What you can do</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>Build versioned questionnaire templates with 12 question types and conditional logic</li>
    <li>Send assessments to vendors via secure, no-login portal links</li>
    <li>Auto-score responses with configurable risk weights and RAG thresholds</li>
    <li>Map answers to ISO 27001, SOC 2, NIST CSF, and Essential Eight controls</li>
    <li>Track findings across all vendors in a unified risk register</li>
    <li>Manage vendor profiles with certifications, attachments, and risk tiers</li>
    <li>Integrate via a full REST API with API key authentication</li>
    <li>Deploy with Docker Compose behind any reverse proxy</li>
  </ul>

